<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#pathOfferingDetailed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Offering details specific to this path. May differ significantly from parent entity offerings. Access: initiated-only."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#Offering> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A material or symbolic offering given to a spiritual entity. Includes food, drink, objects, colors, animals, and actions. General offering categories are public; specific quantities, combinations, and preparation details are access-restricted."@en .
