<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#entityType-lwa-rada> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Spirits of the Rada nanchon in Haitian Vodou. Generally cool, sweet, and beneficent in temperament. Primary Fon/Dahomey origins. Received with white and light colors."@en .
