<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#offering-food> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Prepared or natural foods offered to an entity. Specific foods are tradition and entity specific."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#temperament-cool-sweet> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#TemperamentScheme> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#temperament> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "General temperament classification. Values from TemperamentScheme: iroko:temperament-cool-sweet, iroko:temperament-hot-fierce, iroko:temperament-transformative, iroko:temperament-liminal. Access: public-unrestricted."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#element> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#SpiritualEntity> .
