<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#CommissionTypeScheme> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Named commissions (comisiones) in Espiritismo. Each commission represents a group of spirits sharing a common historical, cultural, or archetypal identity. Documented on espiritu-commission entities via iroko:commissionType."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#commissionType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "For espiritu-commission entities: the specific commission they belong to. Values from CommissionTypeScheme. Access: public-unrestricted."@en .
