<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#syncreticIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Catholic saint or other syncretic correspondence for this entity. Prevents santos from slipping through classification gaps. Example: Shango syncretizes with Santa Barbara in Lucumi; Ogou with Saint Jacques in Vodou. Free text to accommodate regional and lineage variation. Access: public-unrestricted."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#plantAssociation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "plant association"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#lineageNotes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Notes on which lineages recognize this path and any contested aspects of its identity or attributes. Access: community-only."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#SpiritKinshipRelationScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Relações de parentesco espiritual"@pt .
