<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#temperament-transformative> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Entities whose primary nature is change, transition, and transformation. Neither simply cool nor hot; work with both destruction and creation. Example: Oya, Elegba."@en .
