<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#commission-arabe> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Commission of Arab or Moorish spirits. Work with commerce, prosperity, and esoteric knowledge. Reflect historical Moorish presence in Iberian culture transmitted to the Caribbean."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#pathSyncreticIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
