<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#temperament-cool-sweet> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Entities of cool, gentle, beneficent energy. Approached with white and light colors, cool water, and gentle offerings. Example: Obatala, Yemaya (certain paths), Rada lwa."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#commission-marinero> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Marinero"@en .
