<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#kinship-sibling-of> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "ará fún"@yo .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#syncreticIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#commission-marinero> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sailor"@en .
