<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#temperament-hot-fierce> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Entities of hot, intense, warrior energy. Approached with fire, iron, rum, and strong offerings. Example: Ogun, Shango, Petwo lwa."@en .
