<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#number> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sacred number or numbers associated with this entity. Example: 8 (Oshun), 16 (Obatala), 4 and 6 (Shango). Access: public-unrestricted."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#plantAssociation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#Plant> .
