<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#entityType-mpungo-inquice> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Divine forces in Bantu-derived traditions: Mpungo in Palo Monte and Mayombe, Inquice in Candomble Angola. These are the same cosmic powers known by different names in the Kongo religious continuum. Example: Zarabanda (Palo) corresponds to Ogum (Candomble Angola)."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#temperament-cool-sweet> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Frio"@en .
