<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#commission-intranquil> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Intranquil spirits occupy a contested category in Espiritismo — some practitioners consider them dangerous and do not work with them. Document lineage position via iroko:contestedNotes."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#SpiritKinshipRelationScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#kinship-father-of> .
