<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#entityType-vodun> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Divine forces in Fon/Ewe-derived traditions including Arara in Cuba. Related to but distinct from Haitian lwa; represents the continental Dahomean tradition."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#domain> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#minimumAccessLevel> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#access-public-unrestricted> .
