<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#kinship-parent-of> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use when the gendered parent role is unspecified or ambiguous in source material."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#entityType-egun> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Eggun"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#offering-animal> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Animal"@en .
