<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#commission-intranquil> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Spirits who died in conflict, trauma, or without resolution. Worked cautiously; associated with unrest and unfinished business. Distinct from the other commissions in that they are engaged for specific workings rather than as ongoing guides."@en .
