<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#entityType-espiritu-commission> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A spirit belonging to a named commission (comision) in Espiritismo. Commissions are groups of spirits sharing a common historical, cultural, or archetypal identity. Commission type is documented via iroko:commissionType property and the CommissionTypeScheme."@en .
