<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#polarity-androgynous> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Masculine and feminine qualities are simultaneously present and inseparable. Distinct from aspect-dependent, where polarity shifts between manifestations."@en .
