<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#relatedEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Another spiritual entity with a significant relationship to this one. Example: Elegba and Ogun (road and iron); Oya and Shango (consort). Access: public-unrestricted."@en .
