<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#Shrine> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A consecrated physical space or vessel housing a spiritual entity. Includes ile (houses), soperas, nganga, peristyle altars, and boveda. Shrine records link physical location and custody to the entity and tradition. Operational shrine details are access-restricted."@en .
